    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pLT",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 515,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 26,
      "text": "\"CONFIGURING OAUTH\"  —  set up ONCE, NOT in code",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#5C2D91",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1934102699,
      "index": "aT",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784554207570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"CONFIGURING OAUTH\"  —  set up ONCE, NOT in code",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5294117647058822
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pLlist",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 558,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "•  Entra resource app reg — exposes a scope (the token 'audience')\n\n•  OAuth client app (<your-oauth-client>) — PRE-AUTHORIZED on the resource\n     (the no-admin substitute for admin consent)\n\n•  Foundry MCP tool = OAuth Identity Passthrough → Custom (Foundry does the OBO)\n\n•  Foundry returns the consent card (consent_link); the container surfaces it\n\n•  No admin, no per-user permission-grant prompt — pre-auth clears that gate\n     (the Foundry sign-in card still shows; see box below)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1367270277,
      "index": "aU",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784554207570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Entra resource app reg — exposes a scope (the token 'audience')\n\n•  OAuth client app (<your-oauth-client>) — PRE-AUTHORIZED on the resource\n     (the no-admin substitute for admin consent)\n\n•  Foundry MCP tool = OAuth Identity Passthrough → Custom (Foundry does the OBO)\n\n•  Foundry returns the consent card (consent_link); the container surfaces it\n\n•  No admin, no per-user permission-grant prompt — pre-auth clears that gate\n     (the Foundry sign-in card still shows; see box below)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.1688311688311688
    },
