    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pRT",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 515,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 26,
      "text": "CODE  —  container just RELAYS + surfaces the consent card",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#107C10",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1296181989,
      "index": "aW",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784554207570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CODE  —  container just RELAYS + surfaces the consent card",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5294117647058822
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pRlist",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 558,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "•  Container relays the Activity to the Foundry agent (Managed Identity)\n\n•  FOUNDRY does the OBO (identity passthrough) → per-user JWT to the MCP\n\n•  Container reads Foundry's oauth_consent_request → shows 'Open consent' card\n\n•  (Trial)  MCP reaches Galaxy with a service account — Boundary B stub\n\noauth mode (reserve): the BOT mints + forwards x-ms-user-token instead\n— that's a native func_bot shape; not needed for passthrough.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1064706539,
      "index": "aX",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784554207570,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Container relays the Activity to the Foundry agent (Managed Identity)\n\n•  FOUNDRY does the OBO (identity passthrough) → per-user JWT to the MCP\n\n•  Container reads Foundry's oauth_consent_request → shows 'Open consent' card\n\n•  (Trial)  MCP reaches Galaxy with a service account — Boundary B stub\n\noauth mode (reserve): the BOT mints + forwards x-ms-user-token instead\n— that's a native func_bot shape; not needed for passthrough.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2857142857142858
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
